## SECTION 8: CROSS-MODULE INTEGRATION RULES

- **Ledger Helper** (`server/utils/ledgerHelper.js`): MUST be used for all stock and GL movements. Never write to `stock_ledger_entries` or `general_ledger` directly from routes.
- **MR Tracker Bridge**: `medical_representatives` is authoritative. Do not duplicate visit records in ERP.
- **Audit Logs**: All user-initiated mutations MUST write to `audit_logs`. Include `user_id`, `action`, `table_name`, `record_id`, `old_value`, `new_value`.
- **H1 Drug Gate**: Check `products.schedule` before inserting invoice items. `schedule='H1'` -> MUST insert to `h1_register` in same ACID transaction.
- **DeerFlow Trigger Pattern**: `setImmediate(() => triggerWorkflow({...}))` — always non-blocking. Never `await` inside ACID transaction.

---

## SECTION 9: MANUFACTURING & QUALITY

### Manufacturing

- **Tables**: `boms`, `production_orders`, `raw_materials`, `products`, `batches`
- **BOM Versioning**: Old versions -> `status='Superseded'`. Only ONE `Active` BOM per `product_id`.
- **Production Status Machine**: `Draft -> Scheduled -> In Progress -> QC Pending -> Completed | Cancelled`.
- **Batch on Complete**: ACID — insert `batches` (status='QC_Pending'), write `stock_ledger_entries` IN.
- **Role Guard**: BOM and production order mutations require `PRODUCTION_MANAGER` or `ADMIN`.

### Quality Control

- **ACID on Pass/Fail**: `Passed` -> UPDATE `batches.status='Active'`. `Failed` -> UPDATE `batches.status='Rejected'` + `batches.stock=0`.
- **No Hard Delete**: QC records are regulatory documents. Soft-delete via `status='Voided'` only.
- **COA**: Only after `final_status='Passed'`.

### R&D Lab

- **Stage Gate**: `stage='Approved'` requires at least one linked experiment with `status='Completed'` and `result_data`.
- **Version Control**: Editing bumps version. Old row -> `stage='Superseded'`, new row inserted.

---

## SECTION 10: HUMAN CAPITAL

### HRMS

- **Tables**: `employees`, `hr_departments`, `hr_designations`, `hr_salary_structures`, `hr_attendance`, `hr_leaves`, `hr_leave_balances`, `hr_leave_policies`, `hr_employee_documents`, `hr_onboarding_tasks`, `hr_shifts`, `hr_timesheet_entries`, `hr_reimbursement_claims`, `hr_incidents`, `hr_performance_reviews`, `hr_employee_timeline`
- **Employee UUID**: Always use `uuidv4()`. Validate with `isUUID()` before DB queries.
- **Department Hierarchy**: Use CTE (`WITH RECURSIVE dept_hierarchy`). Never flatten manually.
- **Status Lifecycle**: `Active | On Leave | Terminated | Resigned`. Do NOT delete employee records.
- **Leave Balance**: Always UPDATE `hr_leave_balances.remaining` when leave is approved.

### HR & Payroll

- **Engine**: `server/utils/hrPayrollEngine.js`.
- **Payroll Run**: ACID per employee. Rollback entire batch on error.
- **Statutory Rates**: ALWAYS pull from `hr_statutory_config`. NEVER hardcode PF/ESIC/PT percentages.
- **Mark Paid**: Write `payment_vouchers` entry via `ledgerHelper`.

---

## SECTION 11: FINANCE & GOVERNANCE

### Accounts (General Accounting)

- **Tables**: `chart_of_accounts`, `general_ledger`, `journal_vouchers`, `journal_voucher_entries`, `acc_periods`, `acc_ratios_cache`, `financial_years`, `cost_centers`, `budgets`, `bank_reconciliations`, `forex_rates`
- **2FA on ALL accounting writes**: Do NOT remove `verify2FAMiddleware`.
- **Double-Entry Enforcement**: `SUM(debit) = SUM(credit)` or reject with 400.
- **Journal Voucher Lifecycle**: `Draft -> Posted -> Reversed`. Only Posted JVs affect GL.
- **Period Locking**: `acc_periods.is_locked` -> reject GL writes with 400.
- **Financial Statements**: NEVER pre-aggregate — compute fresh from GL every time.

### Voucher Setup

- **Receipt**: Debit Cash/Bank, Credit Debtors ledger.
- **Payment**: Debit Creditors ledger, Credit Cash/Bank.
- **No Deletion**: Reverse with equal-and-opposite entry, set `status='Reversed'`.

### Compliance

- **License Expiry States**: `valid` | `expiring` (0-30 days) | `expired` | `suspended`.
- **H1 Register**: Required fields: `drug_name`, `batch_number`, `patient_name`, `doctor_name`, `quantity`, `entry_date`.
- **Audit Checklist**: `compliance_audits` stores scored results.

### Parties

- **Party Types**: `Debtor` (customer), `Creditor` (supplier), `Both`.
- **Balance Integrity**: `parties.current_balance` is DENORMALIZED. Update on every invoice/receipt/payment.
- **Merge Rule**: Never merge party records. Use `syncPartnerToParty` for conversions.

---

## SECTION 12: INTELLIGENCE & ADMIN

### Dashboard

- **Company Scoping**: ALL dashboard queries filter `company_id`. Cross-company data leakage is a critical bug.
- **AI Generate**: `POST /api/reports/ai-generate` must not block — use `setImmediate`.
- **Data Freshness**: Include `generated_at` timestamp in all dashboard responses.

### Intelligence Center

- **Async Reports**: `POST /api/analytics/reports/generate` -> `{ jobId }`. Poll `GET /api/analytics/reports/status/:jobId`.
- **2FA**: Comprehensive inventory analytics require `verify2FAMiddleware`.
- **Job Queue**: Uses PostgreSQL `report_jobs` table as shared queue (PM2 cluster-safe). In-memory Maps are NOT cluster-safe.

### Deerflow Control

- **Workflow Log**: ALL `triggerWorkflow` calls write to `audit_logs` first.
- **Known Workflow IDs**: `EMPLOYEE_ONBOARDING_INITIATED`, `JOURNAL_VOUCHER_CREATED`, `LEAD_CONVERTED`, `INVENTORY_SYNC`, `OMS_SLA_BREACH`, `PAYROLL_RUN`, `GST_FILING_TRIGGERED`, `PRODUCTION_COMPLETE`.

### Reports

- **Date Params**: Accept `?from=YYYY-MM-DD&to=YYYY-MM-DD` or `?month=M&year=YYYY`.
- **Export**: Support `?format=csv` -> `Content-Type: text/csv`.
- **GST Reports**: GSTR-1 (outward), GSTR-2 (inward, supports recon=true), GSTR-3B (net payable).

### Audit Logs

- **Immutable**: NEVER UPDATE or DELETE from `audit_logs`. Append-only.
- **Required Fields**: `user_id`, `action` (VERB_NOUN), `module`, `status`, `ip_address`, `details` (JSONB).
- **Pagination**: Default `limit=50`, `ORDER BY created_at DESC`.

---

## SECTION 13: ENTERPRISE HUB & SETTINGS

- **Storage Pattern**: `erp_settings` is key-value (`key VARCHAR PK`, `value TEXT as JSON`). Use `getSetting`/`saveSetting` helpers only.
- **Factory Reset**: ADMIN only. Requires `{ confirm: true }`. Does NOT touch business data tables.
- **Export**: Exclude sensitive keys (`GMAIL_APP_PASSWORD`, `JWT_SECRET`).
- **Financial Year**: Only one `is_active=true` at a time. Lock closes year for GL postings.
- **API Keys**: Never expose in logs or error messages.
